    "SCHEMA_NAME": "FAM_PHYSICAL_VERIFICATION_STATUS",
    "SCHEMA_DESCR": "Physical Verification Status. For the selected branch (default All), finds the single most recent verification cycle (FAM_PHYSICAL_VERIFICATION, ranked by VERIFICATION_DATE DESC then VERIFICATION_CYCLE_NO DESC) and counts its lines (FAM_PHYSICAL_VERIFICATION_LINE) by PHYSICAL_STATUS_FOUND. Lines not yet verified (PHYSICAL_STATUS_FOUND is null) are grouped under a synthetic 'PENDING' label so an in-progress cycle still renders a complete breakdown. ASSUMPTION: 'latest verification cycle' is interpreted as the single latest cycle across all locations within the selected branch (a branch can have several locations, each with its own cycles) - if a branch has multiple concurrent latest-dated cycles across locations, only the one with the highest VERIFICATION_CYCLE_NO on that date is shown. The dashboard's FINANCIAL_YEAR filter does not apply here since a verification cycle is not FY-scoped in the FRS.",
    "SCHEMA_TYPE": "S",
    "OUTPUT_TYPE": "JSON",
    "DATABASE_TYPE": "1",
    "DATABASE_DETAIL": { "DATABASE_NAME": "PostgreSQL", "TYPE": 1 }
